    "text": "giraffe (Replication). Full surface selects seed 11, while the unavailable hidden-MAE oracle selects seed 33. Gain versus the pool mean is +0.0011. The gallery exposes every case, including all losses. The candidates retain the recognizable brown-and-white patch pattern, but their generated neck and head positions differ from the source. All four hidden pixel errors remain high and close together (0.2485-0.2610). Full surface selects the smallest boundary loss, while the local rule finds the pixel-error oracle, yet even the oracle has little headroom over the pool mean. Surface compatibility alone does not identify the original pose, and this pool cannot provide a low-error reconstruction."
