    "text": "horse (Pilot test). Full surface selects seed 33, while the unavailable hidden-MAE oracle selects seed 33. Gain versus the pool mean is +0.1185. The gallery exposes every case, including all losses. Seed 33 extends dark target structure into the hidden side; the other candidates mostly replace that area with water. Its held-out mask recall is 0.74, compared with 0.01-0.04 for the alternatives, and it has lower pixel error. However, it also introduces a conspicuous pale upright protrusion on the right. The numerical gain is real under the fixed metric, while the completed structure still has visible defects. This example is included to prevent equating a metric win with a correct completion."
